<title>USA: US banks free reserves $838 mln Nov 6 rvsd two wks.</title>
<headline>US banks free reserves $838 mln Nov 6 rvsd two wks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. commercial banks had revised free reserves of $838 million per day in the two weeks ended November 6, versus revised free reserves of $645 million in the previous two-week period, the Federal Reserve said.</p>
<p>Seasonal borrowings were $154 million versus $205 million a day. Extended credits were nil.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
</text>
